  "description": "Enterprise-grade FastMCP framework for .NET. Features multimodal content handling (McpContent, McpMediaLoader for universal local/remote/data-URI image resolution), OAuth 2.0/OIDC (Azure AD, Google, GitHub, Auth0, Okta, Cognito), per-tool MFA, OpenTelemetry metrics/tracing, health checks, and a native .NET client library. Built on ASP.NET Core for .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
