  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0 Multimodal Release:\n- Universal McpMediaLoader: Load images and media from HTTP/HTTPS URLs, local files, file:// URIs, Base64 data: URIs, with automatic header/magic-byte MIME sniffing.\n- McpContent multimodal factory methods: ImageFromBytes, ImageFromStreamAsync, ImageFromUriAsync, Json, ResourceText, ResourceBlob, Composite.\n- Eliminates duplicate image fetching boilerplate across AI agent microservices.",
